# Allow-list: the image gets the engine, its contracts, the source configs, the committed eval
# results and the query files it replays recorded wordings from (engine wording.py), nothing else.
# .env, data/, .venv and node_modules never reach the build context, with or without BuildKit.
*
!engine/pyproject.toml
!engine/src
!contracts
!sources
!eval/results
!eval/*.jsonl
!infra/demo/queries.jsonl
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
